图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Voice input plugin for DeepSeek Harness: mic → local/browser speech recognition → text submitted as a normal chat message. Input-only and preset-agnostic.","id":"gh:1334554745","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-voice","slug":"3274375092/dsh-voice","topics":["dsh","dsh-bundle","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Voice input plugin for DeepSeek Harness: mic → local/browser speech recognition → text submitted as "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"a normal chat message. Input-only and preset-agnostic."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-voice 🎤"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A voice input plugin for DeepSeek Harness: click 🎤 in the web UI (or press a hotkey), speak, and the"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" recognized text is submitted as a normal chat message. **Input only** — it never touches the agent "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"preset/persona, so it behaves like \"another input method\" in every mode."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 🎤 **Voice input**: microphone button (platform design-system UI) + configurable global hotkey (Ctr"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"l+Space by default)\n- ⚡ **Live recognition**: streaming partial transcripts are echoed while you spe"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ak; VAD finalization commits on stop (0.6s tail padding keeps sentence endings)\n- 🧠 **Adaptive dual "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"engine**: host-native ASR (sherpa-onnx-node zipformer2 + silero VAD, offline/private) with automatic"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" fallback to browser Web Speech (zero extra dependencies)\n- 🔌 **Preset-agnostic**: does not touch th"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"e persona/system prompt; works with code/standard/minimal/custom presets\n- 📦 **Optional models**: ze"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ro-config out of the box; run `dsh-voice-models` when you want native offline recognition"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The row-level `config` is received by the host half. `engine` and `hotkey` are synced to the browser"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" half over the `/voice.config` loopback RPC, so there is no separate client config to write. `auto` "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"probes host native capability: with a model it uses native; without one it falls back to Web Speech,"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" so zero-config users keep working. Restart `dsh web` after changing the config."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"See USAGE.md and INSTALL.md (Chinese) for details."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Engine selection: the host resolves the effective engine (config + model-load result) and the client"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" consumes it via `/voice.ping` — native unavailable falls back to browser Web Speech. `/voice.config"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"` carries the row-level `engine`/`hotkey` from host to client."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The build only ever runs on the publisher's side (`prepack` — at `npm pack`/`npm publish` time) and "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"in CI before release; consumers installing `@nn12138/dsh-voice` from the registry never execute life"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"cycle scripts, so `--ignore-scripts` installs are complete and usable (see issue #2)."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Keeping up with DSH"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`typecheck` runs against the hand-written stubs in `src/ambient.d.ts`, which cannot detect DSH API d"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"rift by construction — the stubs describe whatever the source already assumes. Two checks close that"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"by construction — the stubs describe whatever the source already assumes. Two checks close that gap:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **`verify:runtime`** (no DSH install needed) replays the real `client-modules` resolution contract"},{"id":"p21s2","text":": it loads `lib/client.js` through the live platform module table, then calls `apply()` on both halv"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"es with contexts shaped like the shipping API. A bundle that requires a module the platform no longe"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"r seeds fails here instead of silently at page load.\n- **`verify:types`** compiles `src/` with `src/"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"ambient.d.ts` **excluded**, resolving each specifier to the real packages in a DSH install. Point it"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"d.ts` **excluded**, resolving each specifier to the real packages in a DSH install. Point it at one:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"It exits 0 with a skip notice when `DSH_PACKAGES_DIR` is unset, so CI stays green without a DSH chec"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"kout. Run it before a release against the DSH version you target."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Real-model smoke tests look for the local `voxelf` assets and skip when absent; override with:\n`DSH_"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"VOICE_MODEL_DIR` (model directory) / `DSH_VOICE_TEST_WAV` (test wav) / `DSH_VOICE_DOWNLOADED_MODELS`"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" (downloaded model directory)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Layout: `src/index.ts` (host half) / `src/client/` (browser half) / `src/core/` (recognition core) /"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" `tools/` (wire-protocol smoke tools + model downloader)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
